OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785431953
OL,3,CJet-ski and Rolex watches seized from
OL,4,Chouse during drugs raid
OL,6,FA jet-ski, luxury watches, and a fleet
OL,7,Fof vehicles have been seized by police
OL,8,Ffollowing a drugs raid on a home.
OL,10,FTwo Rolex watches, an e-bike and four
OL,11,Fvehicles were also taken by officers
OL,12,Fwho carried out the warrant in Speke,
OL,13,FLiverpool, as part of an investigation
OL,14,Finto drug supply.
OL,16,FMerseyside Police said the high-value
OL,17,Fitems were suspected of being paid for
OL,18,Fwith the proceeds of criminality.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
