CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785431953
OL,3,CJet-ski and Rolex watches seized from
OL,4,Chouse during drugs raid
OL,6,FPolice also seized a quantity of cash,
OL,7,Fa PS5 game console, gaming equipment
OL,8,Fand two iPhones.
OL,10,FThe four vehicles taken included a
OL,11,Fwhite Mercedes X250 pick-up truck and
OL,12,Fa Peugeot Boxer van.
OL,14,FA man, 37, and woman, 29, both from
OL,15,FSpeke, were arrested on suspicion of
OL,16,Facquiring/using/possessing criminal
OL,17,Fproperty and possession with intent to
OL,18,Fsupply cannabis. They have since been
OL,19,Freleased on conditional bail.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
