PN,36903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785431953
OL,3,CJet-ski and Rolex watches seized from
OL,4,Chouse during drugs raid
OL,6,FChief Inspector Kev Chatterton said:
OL,7,F"Offenders involved in the supply of
OL,8,Fdrugs bring fear, violence and
OL,9,Fintimidation into the heart of our
OL,10,Fcommunities.
OL,12,F"They do so to line their own pockets
OL,13,Fwhile others go out and earn an honest
OL,14,Fliving.
OL,16,F"We simply will not tolerate this and
OL,17,Fconduct warrants, stop searches, land
OL,18,Fsearches and targeted operations all
OL,19,Fyear round in order to disrupt their
OL,20,Factivities so that they realise crime
OL,21,Fdoes not pay.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUxD@AOU
