OL,3,CJet-ski and Rolex watches seized from
OL,4,Chouse during drugs raid
OL,6,F"I want to reassure those communities
OL,7,Faffected that we will continue putting
OL,8,Foffenders before the courts and
OL,9,Fseizing their ill-gotten gains."
